[0.074, "o", "usage: wiki.py\r\n       [-h]\r\n       {help,doctor,reindex,ingest,review,ask,search,chat}\r\n       ...\r\n\r\nPip: local\r\nGemma\r\npersonal\r\nwiki. No\r\ncloud\r\nfallback;\r\nPython\r\nstandard\r\nlibrary\r\nonly.\r\n\r\npositional arguments:\r\n  {help,doctor,reindex,ingest,review,ask,search,chat}\r\n    help\r\n    Show\r\n    commands\r\n    doctor\r\n    Inspect\r\n    local model\r\n    and device\r\n    reindex\r\n    Rebuild\r\n    original-\r\n    source\r\n    retrieval\r\n    without\r\n    calling\r\n    Gemma\r\n    ingest\r\n    Generate\r\n    wiki drafts\r\n    and index\r\n    registered\r\n    originals\r\n    review\r\n    Explicitly\r\n    mark a\r\n    checked\r\n    wiki page\r\n    as reviewed\r\n    ask\r\n    Independent\r\n    grounded\r\n    answer\r\n    search\r\n    Original\r\n    passages;\r\n    no model\r\n    call\r\n    chat\r\n    Conversatio\r\n    nal\r\n    assistant;\r\n    /exit to\r\n    end, /reset\r\n    to clear\r\n    history\r\n\r\noptional arguments:\r\n  -h, --help\r\n    show this\r\n    help\r\n    message and\r\n    exit\r\n"]
